## 5. Logging & Error Handling (Optional)

| Requirement | Status | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| Backend logging (ILogger) | ⚠️ | `ILogger` is injected in some pages (Error, Index, Privacy) but **not actively used** for custom logging |
| Log exceptions | ❌ | No custom exception logging |
| Log failed logins | ❌ | No custom logging in Login page |
| Log critical operations | ❌ | No logging on CRUD operations |
| Global exception handling | ⚠️ | Only `app.UseExceptionHandler("/Error")` for non-dev — basic |
| Custom error page | ⚠️ | [Error.cshtml](file:///c:/Users/eomis/CS392%20Project/CS392/Yummiez/Yummiez/Pages/Error.cshtml) exists but is the **default template** — not customized |

### What to Add

#### ❌ Add custom logging in key areas:
1. **Failed logins** — In `Areas/Identity/Pages/Account/Login.cshtml.cs`, add `_logger.LogWarning(...)` when login fails
2. **CRUD operations** — Add `_logger.LogInformation(...)` in Create/Edit/Delete handlers for Restaurants and TestRecords
3. **Exceptions** — Add `_logger.LogError(...)` in catch blocks

#### ❌ Configure logging output:
Add file logging in [Program.cs](file:///c:/Users/eomis/CS392%20Project/CS392/Yummiez/Yummiez/Program.cs) (e.g., using Serilog or a simple file logger), or at minimum configure console logging levels in [appsettings.json](file:///c:/Users/eomis/CS392%20Project/CS392/Yummiez/Yummiez/appsettings.json):
```json
"Logging": {
  "LogLevel": {
    "Default": "Information",
    "Microsoft.AspNetCore": "Warning",
    "Yummiez": "Debug"
  }
}
```

#### ⚠️ Customize the error page:
The current [Error.cshtml](file:///c:/Users/eomis/CS392%20Project/CS392/Yummiez/Yummiez/Pages/Error.cshtml) is the default ASP.NET template. Make it match your Yummiez branding/theme with a user-friendly message.

#### ❌ Add global exception handling middleware (optional but impressive):
```csharp
// In Program.cs
app.UseStatusCodePagesWithReExecute("/Error/{0}");
```

